guide forever/class/rogue/the-horn-of-xelthos
title The Horn of Xelthos
category Class
class Rogue
folder Rogue
levels 23-26
zone Silverpine Forest
keywords The Horn of Xelthos, C's dead drop, Dead Drop, Pyrewood Village, Veenix, Goblin Lockpicks, Venture Co. Work Order, Breaching Charge, Shadowfang Keep, Pyrewood Signet Ring, Rogue, solo dungeon

# C's first job, for Rogues of both factions: The Horn of Xelthos (78261)
# from the Dead Drop near Pyrewood Village, Goblin Lockpicks (78270) with
# Veenix in the Stonetalon Mountains for a Breaching Charge, the horn from
# inside Shadowfang Keep, then C's payment (78307) from the same Dead Drop.
# Forever changes (Wowhead Forever's Rogue class page,
# data/local/quest-audit/wowhead-class-quests.json): 78261 now has the
# "find Veenix" objective; 78307 pays 2300 experience and 30 silver and adds
# the Pyrewood Signet Ring. Wowhead's row also lists Rune of Deadly Brew
# (203994) among 78307's rewards, a Season of Discovery rune; the guide shows
# only the ring.
# Sources: quests.json and objects.json (the Dead Drop, object 410369, starts
# and ends both Horn quests; foreverchanges.pro/quest/78261 agrees), npcs.json
# for Veenix, items.json for the Venture Co. Work Order (Venture Co. Loggers);
# Wowhead's Forever tooltip (nether.wowhead.com/forever/tooltip/item/210186)
# for the Breaching Charge, Goblin Lockpicks' reward; the quest texts on
# foreverchanges.pro for Veenix's request and the solo rule; the Shadowfang
# Keep entrance from data/forever/dungeons.json (Silverpine Forest
# 44.8,67.8, live frame). The data has no position for the horn inside the
# keep.
# The quest says you must do the job alone: Shadowfang Keep is a dungeon
# full of elites; stealth through.

step C's dead drop
  tip The Dead Drop is a chest near Pyrewood Village in southern Silverpine, just south of Shadowfang Keep. Read C's note.
  level 23
  accept 78261 object 410369                  -- Dead Drop

step Veenix
  zone Stonetalon Mountains
  tip Veenix, a goblin friendly to both factions, stands among the Venture Co. in the Windshear Crag, east Stonetalon. Horde fly to Sun Rock Retreat; Alliance to Stonetalon Peak. He wants a Venture Co. Work Order before he hands over explosives: the Venture Co. Loggers around him carry them.
  talk 4086                                   -- Veenix
  accept 78270
  collect 210187 x1                           -- Venture Co. Work Order: Venture Co. Logger
  turnin 78270 reward 210186 "Breaching Charge"

step Shadowfang Keep
  zone Silverpine Forest
  tip Go in alone. The Breaching Charge gets you past the courtyard gate; the data does not say where in the keep the horn lies.
  collect 210183 quest 78261.1 @44.8,67.8 live -- Horn of Xelthos, inside Shadowfang Keep

step Back to the dead drop
  tip Place the horn in the Dead Drop near Pyrewood. C's payment is the second Horn of Xelthos quest at the same chest.
  turnin 78261 object 410369                  -- Dead Drop
  accept 78307 object 410369
  turnin 78307 object 410369 reward 277210    -- Pyrewood Signet Ring
